<note>
    <title>Food Chemistry: The Maillard Reaction</title>
    <content>
<![CDATA[
<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM 'http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd'>
<en-note>
<h2>Maillard reaction</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Nonenzymatic browning that contributes flavor and color in cooked foods.</li>
  <li>Occurs between reducing sugars and amino acids.</li>
</ul>
<p>Reference: <a href="https://www.britannica.com/science/Maillard-reaction">Britannica: Maillard reaction</a></p>
</en-note>
]]>
